margin-bottom:24.0pt;margin-left:0in"><span class="SCCCounselNameChar"><span style="font-style:normal">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Ritu Khullar</span><span class="SCCCounselNameChar"><span style="font-style:normal">, </span>Q.C.</span><span class="SCCCounselPartyRoleChar">, and <i>Vanessa Cosco</i>, for the intervener the United Nurses of Alberta.</span></p>
